{"candidate_identity":"51d7639d98318ff4eb80695989478408fe6fde00be5c0c25379fbc7b2d7d29a1","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"46812ce4f2d7b10452c6c96aca421e8aa07e8b3f2316be505cce6f5192660bc3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"06354c04e3578d6db968b28f746193d094f82a56c9f50edb678b15487c163267","logical_entry_identity":"d0103a17bfc4ce1565577de761a13714285504540300d39fb055513c73fbb702","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"hit up to two adjacent enemies","source_tag":"_t","target":"攻击你身边最多 2 个相邻敌人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e2b2b52aeb6301118b271131ad8165ab6af769dd66c464f39130052614d979f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"39f151f3e34823e09ae9bc2512556fb79b1c66164154ba6f70d94a6750381cdd","logical_entry_identity":"5ca8ad63e1b9d4bd818dc6f76794c851e821e6421f1da4fe7b21456196cb2fa1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Quickly reload your ammo by %d (depends on masteries and object bonuses).\n\t\tDoing so requires no turn but you are considered disarmed for 2 turns.\n\n\t\tReloading does not break stealth.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"立刻装填 %d 弹药（数量取决于专精与装备加成）。\n\t\t此举不消耗回合，但你在 2 回合内被视为缴械。\n\n\t\t装填弹药不会打破潜行。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0e3768b384fde68b4acc45f3883c24237c854bd56535b46078124697df9265e7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"49737fd68d70a2b422b7503c6baabc1fa214b44cfd4e77babf9ec0186084af86","logical_entry_identity":"a22a41785427f3693971a14949193c4897c95855357181a4f25e1970ca10642b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Physical critical chance#LAST#\nEach time you deal damage with a physical ability you may have a chance to perform a critical hit that deals extra damage.\nSome talents allow you to increase this percentage, and it may be modified by your weapon.\nIt is improved by Cunning.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#物理暴击#LAST#\n每次以物理技能造成伤害时你都有一定几率暴击造成额外伤害。\n一些技能可以提高这个几率，它也可能受你的武器影响。\n灵巧属性可以提升这个几率。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ad8c957c997e9ef8642ddba43ed368b39a9cfd21515392248495f8eaef855ffa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86f5ce9f73a079f756d7cd55783a91e3627d36a1a0e975fa469a2a358764006b","logical_entry_identity":"ada23a05eacdfd03e57f884f332a73cd030c1bea732b5b06e5b51e4714b1adf3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Surround yourself with a shield that will absorb at most %d non-physical, non-mind element damage per attack.\n\t\tEach time damage is absorbed by the shield, your equilibrium increases by 1 for every 30 points of damage and a standard Equilibrium check is made. If the check fails, the shield will crumble and Antimagic Shield will go on cooldown.\n\t\tThe damage the shield can absorb will increase with your Mindpower or Physical power (whichever is greater).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"给你增加一个护盾，每次被攻击吸收最多 %d 点非物理、非精神元素伤害。\n\t\t每当护盾吸收伤害时，都会按每 30 点伤害增加 1 点失衡值，并进行一次失衡值鉴定；若鉴定失败，则护盾会破碎且技能会进入冷却状态。\n\t\t护盾的最大伤害吸收值受精神或物理强度较高者加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6be67ce757ff82de58aa0f99b862928ee79a2f65dcaa087013854f3ee07bc1ba","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"89ef02d792ed34fba88ad9e54af32c9c7ab17fff50eb85f830d0a06153e8aa6c","logical_entry_identity":"424f0f68f11de160eb4f38462573ac10498fcefca5ed412283241f86d0ebe70f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An iridescent shard of violet crystal.  Its light ebbs and flows, sometimes fast and sometimes slow, keeping pace with the chaotic streams of time itself.  It makes you feel both old and young, a newborn child and an ancient being, your flesh simply one instance in a thousand refractions of a single timeless and eternal soul.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这是一块闪着虹彩的紫色水晶碎片。它的光芒忽明忽暗、时缓时快，与时间本身的混乱流动同步。握着它时，你感到自己既年轻又苍老，既是初生的婴孩又是远古的存在；你的肉身不过是同一个超越时间的永恒灵魂在千重折射中的一个影像。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f438b65f3a357b34272d89dacce0ba620db5e1e58673c76d1332ea5a5c84211e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a270b3d7f1eb856e9b66638e9b29edd57d35261ffc663c5130efb7111c5f1e06","logical_entry_identity":"c37baedd5b12994eabfe6e01fa163770aabffa19d23454abd1d8740b180c5b1b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Shield Block Value#LAST#\nThe base amount of damage a shield will block when actively used in defense.\nMind damage cannot be blocked. Against other damage types you gain a 50%% bonus to the block value if the shield used grants resistance to that damage type.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#盾牌格挡值#LAST#\n盾牌在主动用于防御时所能阻挡的基础伤害量。\n精神伤害无法被格挡。面对其他伤害类型时，如果所用盾牌提供该类型的抗性，你的格挡值会获得 50%% 加成。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"abed7dc1c46b7be3529fd9c060b0cfa8bf02d2cd9cf980d809d94290e15b93fa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c230cd7dee1356dae5a182e56b1734d3d84f80bf1b9be398d0cecc9402f3c6fd","logical_entry_identity":"1afcb09cc976663439093f4df7879aad2660412564d5c0cb8fa3a65d27870ba3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +5 Willpower, +3 Cunning","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 魔法，+5 意志，+3 灵巧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"787ab41dda69911001e7988ba7d0681b71fb091ce46b0354e1aa35e2cf1b7d73","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2346d914146827990f0030d31dbc3cedaccb93ef85aa066a597af7694a55a22","logical_entry_identity":"33d4d2192299b30db00bb8d54a6f8be9b28062603a6f200f61bade6cf69c7d08","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is encased in ice!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#被冻结在冰块中！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"931f6ecbb285d63288aea1eec5ef71744fa6f890f196d216b345e0eeaccd3fca","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c23836c13843e276d0d0548f35f8762fade0814656833cc99d49b685b68759ca","logical_entry_identity":"3bf05f86018a7903df325fa42fbf2632a684fa52e430ff6ae4b9dc1e50b305f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Grappling Hook","source_tag":"talent name","target":"钩爪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1b380819b90e696862f23891c5a5dc8de18dbd21a5f28a64d3c32b23c810e5c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c23d396f1495b824a17924d90cd5f532efc9